35:["$","h2","h2-2",{"id":"jeddah-jed-the-gateway-for-umrah","children":"Jeddah (JED): the gateway for Umrah"}]
36:["$","p","p-4",{"children":["Jeddah handles the largest share of international pilgrims, so the airport's busiest hours are often at night. The key journey is ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"JED to Makkah"}]," — about 80 km, around an hour — usually made ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"already in Ihram"}],", because the Miqat is crossed in the air before landing (see our ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/complete-miqat-locations-guide-umrah-pilgrims","children":"Miqat guide"}],"). Keep passports handy for the checkpoint on the road into Makkah."]}]
37:["$","p","p-5",{"children":["Other common trips: Jeddah city and the Corniche (~20 km), ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/jeddah-to-madinah-taxi-guide-fares","children":"Madinah"}]," (~410 km, ~4 hr) and ",["$","$L26","a-1",{"href":"/routes/jeddah-airport-to-taif","children":"Taif"}]," (~180 km). The Haramain high-speed railway also has a station at the airport — a good option for light travellers, though you need a car at the Makkah or Madinah end."]}]
38:["$","h2","h2-3",{"id":"riyadh-ruh-business-arrivals","children":"Riyadh (RUH): business arrivals"}]
39:["$","p","p-6",{"children":["RUH serves the capital and most business visitors. Central Riyadh is about 35 km away and KAFD about 40 km — 30–35 minutes off-peak, much longer at commuter peaks. The Riyadh Metro's Yellow Line links the airport with KAFD for light travellers. Many executives turn the airport transfer into the start of a working day by adding hours to the booking. Full detail in our ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/riyadh-airport-ruh-taxi-guide","children":"RUH arrival guide"}],"."]}]
3a:["$","h2","h2-4",{"id":"madinah-med-the-gentle-start","children":"Madinah (MED): the gentle start"}]
3b:["$","p","p-7",{"children":["MED is close to the city: the hotels around Masjid an-Nabawi are about 22 km away. Many pilgrims start their trip here, then travel to Makkah by road with a stop at the Abyar Ali Miqat (see ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/madinah-to-makkah-taxi-price-distance-time","children":"Madinah to Makkah by car"}],"). Others go straight from ",["$","$L26","a-1",{"href":"/routes/madinah-airport-to-makkah","children":"MED to Makkah"}]," — about 450 km."]}]
3c:["$","h2","h2-5",{"id":"dammam-dmm-the-eastern-province","children":"Dammam (DMM): the Eastern Province"}]
3d:["$","p","p-8",{"children":["DMM serves Dammam, Al Khobar, Dhahran and Jubail. Distances across the region vary a lot, so give the exact address. Business visitors often go straight to sites with controlled gates — share the gate and host details. See our ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/eastern-province-corporate-visitor-transport-guide","children":"Eastern Province guide"}],"."]}]
3e:["$","h2","h2-6",{"id":"alula-tabuk-the-red-sea-and-the-south","children":"AlUla, Tabuk, the Red Sea and the south"}]
3f:["$","p","p-9",{"children":["Smaller airports have ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"few on-demand taxis"}],", so a pre-booked transfer is essential rather than optional. At ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/alula-travel-guide-hegra-dadan-transport","children":"AlUla (ULH)"}],", resorts are spread through the valley; at Tabuk, the NEOM area is about 120 km away; at Red Sea International, resorts are reached by road from the terminal."]}]
40:["$","h2","h2-7",{"id":"choosing-the-vehicle","children":"Choosing the vehicle"}]
41:["$","p","p-10",{"children":"Luggage decides more than seats, especially for Umrah."}]
42:["$","div","table-1",{"className":"blog-table not-prose","children":["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead","thead-0",{"children":["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","th","th-0",{"children":"Vehicle category"}],["$","th","th-1",{"children":"Example models"}],["$","th","th-2",{"children":"Passengers"}],["$","th","th-3",{"children":"Large bags"}]]}]}],["$","tbody","tbody-0",{"children":[["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Executive sedan"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Toyota Camry, Ford Taurus, Genesis G80"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"3–4"}],["$","td","td-3",{"children":"2"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-1",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Full-size SUV"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"GMC Yukon XL, Cadillac Escalade"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Up to 7"}],["$","td","td-3",{"children":"4–5"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-2",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Van"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Hyundai Staria, Hyundai Starex"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Up to 7"}],["$","td","td-3",{"children":"4–10"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-3",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Luxury sedan"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Mercedes S-Class, BMW 7 Series"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"3"}],["$","td","td-3",{"children":"2"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-4",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":"Minibus / coaster"}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Toyota Hiace, Toyota Coaster"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"11–17"}],["$","td","td-3",{"children":"16–20"}]]}]]}]]}]}]
43:["$","p","p-11",{"children":["Capacities vary by model — check ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/fleet","children":"vehicle categories"}],". Vehicles are provided through our partner network."]}]
44:["$","h2","h2-8",{"id":"what-international-travellers-should-prepare","children":"What international travellers should prepare"}]
45:["$","ul","ul-0",{"children":["\n",["$","li","li-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Your flight number and terminal."}]," JED and RUH have several terminals; overnight flights often land on the next calendar day."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-1",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"A way to be reached on landing."}]," A Saudi SIM, an eSIM, or the airport Wi-Fi with WhatsApp — see ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/buying-sim-cards-jeddah-airport-stc-mobily-zain","children":"SIM cards at Jeddah Airport"}],"."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-2",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Your destination in writing."}]," Hotel name and area, or a map pin for a private address."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-3",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Documents in your hand luggage"}]," — passport and hotel confirmation."]}],"\n",["$","li","li-4",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Some local currency"}]," for small expenses — see our ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/saudi-riyal-cash-cards-guide-pilgrims","children":"riyal guide"}],"."]}],"\n"]}]
46:["$","h2","h2-9",{"id":"private-transfer-taxi-rank-app-or-train","children":"Private transfer, taxi rank, app or train?"}]
47:["$","div","table-2",{"className":"blog-table not-prose","children":["$","table",null,{"children":[["$","thead","thead-0",{"children":["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","th","th-0",{"children":"Option"}],["$","th","th-1",{"children":"Strengths"}],["$","th","th-2",{"children":"Weaknesses"}]]}]}],["$","tbody","tbody-0",{"children":[["$","tr","tr-0",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Pre-booked transfer"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Fixed fare, no queue, right-sized vehicle, door to door"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Needs booking in advance"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-1",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Airport taxi rank"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"No booking needed"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Queues at busy times; price not agreed in the same way"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-2",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Ride-hailing app"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Often cheapest for short trips"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Needs mobile data; pickup zones; prices rise with demand"}]]}],["$","tr","tr-3",{"children":[["$","td","td-0",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Train / metro"}]}],["$","td","td-1",{"children":"Fast between stations (Haramain at JED, metro at RUH)"}],["$","td","td-2",{"children":"Car still needed at the other end; luggage limits"}]]}]]}]]}]}]
48:["$","p","p-12",{"children":"For a solo traveller with a carry-on landing at midday, an app or train is perfectly reasonable. For families, pilgrims, night arrivals and business travellers, a pre-booked transfer usually wins."}]
49:["$","h2","h2-10",{"id":"departures","children":"Departures"}]
4a:["$","p","p-13",{"children":"For an international departure, work back from your flight: allow time for check-in and security plus the drive, plus a margin for traffic. From Makkah, most travellers leave for JED 4–5 hours before departure; from central Riyadh, around 3 hours. Tell us your flight time and we suggest a pickup time."}]
4b:["$","h2","h2-11",{"id":"groups-and-companies","children":"Groups and companies"}]
4c:["$","p","p-14",{"children":["Delegations, tour groups and Umrah groups can be met by several cars or a coaster timed to one flight. Companies can request a written quote and a company invoice — corporate invoicing can be arranged through our sister company. See our ",["$","$L26","a-0",{"href":"/blog/saudi-arabia-event-conference-transportation-guide","children":"event and conference transport guide"}],"."]}]
4d:["$","h2","h2-12",{"id":"common-questions","children":"Common questions"}]
4e:["$","h3","h3-0",{"id":"do-i-need-to-book-an-airport-transfer-in-advance","children":"Do I need to book an airport transfer in advance?"}]
4f:["$","p","p-15",{"children":"At JED, RUH, MED and DMM it's strongly recommended, especially at night and in peak seasons. At smaller airports such as AlUla, it's essential — on-demand taxis are limited."}]
50:["$","h3","h3-1",{"id":"what-happens-if-my-flight-is-delayed","children":"What happens if my flight is delayed?"}]
51:["$","p","p-16",{"children":"Share your flight number when you book and we check it before pickup, so the pickup is planned around your actual arrival."}]
52:["$","h3","h3-2",{"id":"can-i-pay-by-card","children":"Can I pay by card?"}]
53:["$","p","p-17",{"children":"Our transfers are paid in cash to the driver or by bank transfer. An electronic receipt is available on request."}]
54:["$","h3","h3-3",{"id":"can-i-book-for-someone-else-arriving","children":"Can I book for someone else arriving?"}]
55:["$","p","p-18",{"children":"Yes — give us the traveller's name, flight and phone number, plus your own number as a backup."}]
